<p style="margin-bottom:18px"><strong style="color:var(--ink)">HCM's Role:</strong> JP Medics offers two clearly differentiated models. HCM's product specialists help match body fit, comfort preference, space constraints, warranty needs, and budget to the right JP Medics model. Available at our <strong style="color:var(--ink)">San Jose</strong> and <strong style="color:var(--ink)">Pleasanton</strong> showrooms, or by phone.</p>
