<details><summary>Are JP Medics massage chairs worth it?</summary><div><p>JP Medics massage chairs can be worth it for buyers who value premium construction, refined massage feel, model guidance, and long-term ownership support. They may not be the best fit for shoppers who want the lowest price or the most aggressive massage intensity.</p></div></details>
